# [2026-11-14 Johnny Chu - Chu Hoàng Anh] PHASE-0.148 W3 — bizcity-twin-notebook repo = the runtime package (R-PROD-REPO, same allowlist idea as zalo-brain):
# PHP, contracts, prompts, assets and the built TwinChat UI (ui/dist) only. Sources of the UI (ui/src), docs, tests, diagnostics (R-DIAG-LOCAL),
# reference libraries (_library), logs and build configs stay on the dev machine.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/bizcity-twin-notebook.php
!/zalo-brain.json
!/README.md
!/kg/
!/twinchat/

**/_archived/
**/_library/
**/docs/
**/tests/
**/node_modules/
**/src/
**/diagnostics/
**/.vite/
!**/dist/.vite/
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.code-workspace

/twinchat/ui/*
!/twinchat/ui/dist/
